          "id": "a1011a7",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "text-editor",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<p style=\"font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #4A5568; text-align: center;\">Today, plastics are used in a variety of food processing and packaging machinery applications. Their ability to withstand hot and cold temperatures, harsh chemicals, and corrosion makes them perfect for processing vessels, feeders, and conveyor systems. Our plastics also stay inert, not affecting the taste or appearance, making them the best material for many food applications.</p><p style=\"font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #4A5568; text-align: center;\">Choosing a company like Plastic-Craft, with extensive experience in the industry, can save you time and money by making custom fabricated or factory replacement parts at sometimes half the original cost.</p>",
            "align": "center"
          },
          "elements": []
        }
      ],
      "isInner": false
    },
    {
      "id": "f073245",
      "elType": "container",
      "settings": {
